    "录音前，请确保所有参会者均已获悉会议将被录音，且已根据各地适用法律的规定，获得了所需的同意。知鱼录音不会代你核实同意情况。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before recording, make sure all participants are aware the meeting will be recorded and that you've obtained any consent required by applicable law. Knowing You does not verify consent on your behalf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
